===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[plant]] of the ''[[Brassicaceae]]'' family, ''[[Raphanus sativus]]'', having an [[edible]] [[root]]
# The [[pungent]] root of this plant, usually eaten [[raw]] in [[salad]]s etc

